  "description": "DOFQOI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H69 Dy5 N16 O24,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.592-4.264 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.67-129.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5(H2Lr)2(H2.5Lr)2(NO3)4(μ3-O2)2]·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
